1
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:25,920
Wait a minute.

2
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,360
Can I help you?

3
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:29,800
I want to buy this tricycle.

4
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:30,560
Which one?

5
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:31,400
This one.

6
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:34,760
I just work here.

7
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:35,800
Wait a moment.

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,000
I'll get the boss.

9
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:39,240
Who is it?

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:40,960
-Who wants to buy goods?
-Me.

11
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:41,690
I want to buy.

12
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:43,480
How much do you want?

13
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:44,440
We sell by the ton.

14
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:45,640
Half a ton minimum.

15
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,920
No, I just want this one tricycle.

16
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,770
You came all the way here

17
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:51,080
just to buy one?

18
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:51,930
Not for sale.

19
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:53,120
Get back to work.

20
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:53,650
Hurry up.

21
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:54,520
Wait.

22
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:55,820
How about this?

23
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:57,400
I'll pay extra, okay?

24
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:58,360
How much?

25
00:00:58,760 --> 00:00:59,690
Name your price.

26
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:04,810
I'll give you 6,000.

27
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:07,560
Find a truck and deliver it
to my designated location.

28
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:09,039
6,000?

29
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:10,760
What? Isn't 1,000 enough

30
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,200
for delivery within the city?

31
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:12,960
It's enough.

32
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:14,320
We'll deliver it right away. Let's go.

33
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:15,200
Pay inside.

34
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:22,560
Who's the sucker?

35
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,240
Oh my god,

36
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:24,640
they added a zero.

37
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:34,240
A young guy,

38
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:35,240
around thirty.

39
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:38,080
So young?

40
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:59,600
Who called the police?

41
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:00,200
Officer,

42
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:00,840
I did.

43
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:02,040
Hello.

44
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,700
What's the situation?

45
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:06,840
I walk my bird here all the time.

46
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:09,000
I came early this morning

47
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,729
and noticed something inside.

48
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:12,040
It felt wrong,

49
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:13,300
so I called the police.

50
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:19,800
Did you get a closer look?

51
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:20,640
Man or woman?

52
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,840
I was too scared to look closely.

53
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,960
I think it's a man.

54
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:26,800
Lin,

55
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,600
take his statement

56
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:29,730
and get a signature.

57
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:30,800
Name?

58
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:31,760
Wang Jiashen.

59
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:55,920
How's the leg?

60
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,079
It hurts here.

61
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,600
Did you call an ambulance?

62
00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,800
I already called 120.

63
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,440
They said they're on their way.

64
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:02,680
Thanks for your hard work.

65
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,480
Hold on a little longer,

66
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:04,680
they'll be here soon.

67
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:11,520
Captain Li, you're here.

68
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,320
What's the situation?

69
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,400
It's a hit-and-run.

70
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:15,000
He ran east, straight ahead.

71
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:16,370
What kind of car?

72
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:18,400
A black sedan.

73
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,120
Captain Weng.

74
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:29,920
Hello, what's up, Captain Weng?

75
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:30,960
Hello, Captain Li.

76
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:31,840
Xiao Ze is dead.

77
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:34,400
Who's dead?

78
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,360
Xiao Ze.

79
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:38,240
In the woods
behind the hot pot restaurant.

80
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,040
How did he die?

81
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:41,040
Hanging from a tree, looks like suicide,

82
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:42,200
but we can't rule out homicide.

83
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:42,840
I got it.

84
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,480
See you at the task force

85
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:46,140
when you're done at the scene.

86
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,400
Captain Li, who died?

87
00:03:52,320 --> 00:03:53,180
Xiao Ze is dead.

88
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:13,570
Let me introduce the basic situation.

89
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:15,920
Since the deceased, Xiao Ze,

90
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:18,480
is one of the individuals involved

91
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,120
in our previous 10.23 task force,

92
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:22,000
we have specially invited

93
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,240
our colleagues from forensics
and trace evidence

94
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,160
to attend

95
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:25,440
this case analysis meeting today.

96
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:26,240
Let's begin.

97
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,060
Dr. Gong, you go first.

98
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:32,040
The livor mortis is dark red,

99
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:34,200
distributed on
the uncompressed areas of the back.

100
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:36,720
This is consistent with its development

101
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,180
20 to 24 hours postmortem.

102
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:40,320
Rigor mortis has reached its peak
throughout the body.

103
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:42,280
The jaw and all major joints

104
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:43,760
are completely stiff,

105
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:46,730
further confirming
the estimated time of death.

106
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:49,600
There is a distinct
horseshoe-shaped ligature mark

107
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,440
on the neck.

108
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:52,560
It is wider at the top and narrower
at the bottom, slanting upwards.

109
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:54,600
Epidermal abrasions are accompanied
by subcutaneous hemorrhage,

110
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:57,159
which is consistent with
ligature compression.

111
00:04:57,159 --> 00:04:58,000
Preliminary findings suggest

112
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,120
the deceased died of suicidal asphyxiation

113
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,440
caused by hanging.

114
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:02,480
The estimated time of death is

115
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:04,120
20 to 24 hours ago.

116
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:05,800
That's all from my end.

117
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:06,920
So he committed suicide

118
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,400
by hanging, right?

119
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:09,160
No, no, no.

120
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:11,360
We can't jump to conclusions yet.

121
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:13,020
The forensic doctor just said

122
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,280
the autopsy only proves

123
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:17,240
he died of mechanical asphyxiation.

124
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:20,200
But it could be either
suicide or homicide.

125
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,400
Right, Captain Weng?

126
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:22,840
You're the expert, Captain Li.

127
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:25,100
Let's hear from the trace evidence team.

128
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:28,320
Within a five-meter radius of
where the victim hanged himself,

129
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:30,240
six clear footprints were found,

130
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:31,760
and one blurred, incomplete footprint,

131
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:33,040
distributed irregularly.

132
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,720
There are obvious signs of
pacing back and forth.

133
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:37,200
Preliminary judgment suggests
they were left by two to three people.

134
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,840
The depth of the footprints varies.

135
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:41,640
The two deepest ones are about
80 centimeters apart,

136
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,640
indicating a large stride.

137
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:43,920
It is estimated that the height of
the person who left them...

138
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,600
Over 185 centimeters tall

139
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,000
and on the heavier side.

140
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,400
The rest of the footprints are shallower

141
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:49,240
with shorter strides,

142
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:51,800
likely from a female
or someone of a slighter build.

143
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,400
By the way,

144
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,400
we've already excluded

145
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:54,760
the footprints of the caller

146
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,240
and colleagues like Captain Weng.

147
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:58,040
Since it's an open outdoor area,

148
00:05:58,040 --> 00:06:00,560
we believe this set of female footprints

149
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:00,680
is relatively

150
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:02,340
more valuable for reference.

151
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,320
A female.

152
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:08,840
Shen Xi.

153
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:11,520
Captain Li's intuition was right.

154
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:13,800
We pulled the surveillance near the woods.

155
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,560
Shen Xi was indeed there.

156
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,220
Captain Li,

157
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,760
what do you make of Shen Xi showing up

158
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:23,490
in the woods?

159
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:26,370
Let's talk about the motive first.

160
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:28,160
So far,

161
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,960
we haven't found any.

162
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,640
Then there's the method.

163
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:36,560
Let's assume Shen Xi did kill Xiao Ze.

164
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:38,400
With her small build,

165
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:40,400
how could she hang him on a tree

166
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:41,640
and fake a suicide?

167
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:44,960
Forget about Shen Xi.

168
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:45,840
Could he do it?

169
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:47,000
Could you?

170
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:48,360
Why couldn't I...

171
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,520
I guess I couldn't.

172
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:56,440
Wait. Wait for me.

173
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,440
Officers,

174
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:08,400
hasn't my case been closed already?

175
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:10,600
You wanted to see me so urgently.

176
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:12,320
Is there a problem?

177
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,530
I have a class going on in there.

178
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:15,800
Have a seat.

179
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,800
There are some new developments

180
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,060
we'd like to look into.

181
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,260
Go ahead. What developments?

182
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:28,580
Xiao Ze is dead.

183
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,360
He's

184
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,400
actually dead.

185
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:36,040
Suicide.

186
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,560
By hanging?

187
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:38,640
In the woods

188
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:40,240
on the hill

189
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:42,500
behind the suburban hotpot restaurant.

190
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,540
How do you know?

191
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,320
Ms. Shen,

192
00:07:58,880 --> 00:08:01,040
please calm down a bit.

193
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:01,840
Just

194
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:04,320
tell us exactly what happened.

195
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,080
Okay?

196
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,240
It's my fault he died.

197
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:35,120
My son!

198
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,780
I understand how you feel.

199
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:39,640
We are still investigating.

200
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:41,000
To find out the truth,

201
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:43,360
we need to perform an autopsy.

202
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,850
Please sign this to cooperate.

203
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,720
No.

204
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:50,160
Yesterday,

205
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:52,840
I went to the woods.

206
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,640
Xiao Ze asked me to meet him there.

207
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:57,640
What was his purpose in asking you to go?

208
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:58,560
To negotiate.

209
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:00,040
Negotiate?

210
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:01,570
Negotiate what?

211
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:04,560
It all

212
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,560
started that day.

213
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,920
He came to me

214
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:11,440
right after he was released on bail.

215
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:17,760
Hi, Shen Xi.

216
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:19,440
I'm Xiao Ze.

217
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:21,480
I'm out on bail.

218
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,360
Can I

219
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,520
see you?

220
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,960
I actually guessed why he came.

221
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,530
Probably to confess his feelings.

222
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:32,040
Did he really come
to confess his feelings?

223
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:33,720
It really is.

224
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,520
You rejected him?

225
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,860
I didn't reject him directly,

226
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:40,440
but I made things clear to him.

227
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,560
I have a request too.

228
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,640
I hope you can agree to it.

229
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:46,720
Go ahead.

230
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,360
Please don't

231
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:52,690
be so quick to reject me either.

232
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:55,040
Let's start as regular friends.

233
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:57,480
Can you give me a chance?

234
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:01,240
After spending some time together,

235
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,660
if you really think

236
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:03,960
it won't work out,

237
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:05,600
and

238
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:08,720
want me to disappear,

239
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,840
I promise I won't bother you.

240
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:13,520
Have you eaten?

241
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,360
Let me treat you to a meal.

242
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:16,520
Sure.

243
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,320
But it's my treat.

244
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,580
What do you want to eat?

245
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:21,900
I know a really good hotpot place.

246
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,200
Let me take you there.

247
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:29,640
Bringing up this meal...

248
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:31,780
It was just to change the subject.

249
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,680
I really couldn't accept

250
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:35,400
Xiao Ze's advances.

251
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:38,360
I figured since we're neighbors,

252
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:40,200
having a friend to look out for each other

253
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,640
isn't a bad thing.

254
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:45,320
So that dinner went pretty well.

255
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,200
But who knew

256
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:50,140
his idea of being just friends

257
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:52,200
meant calling dozens of times a day?

258
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:54,720
At first I felt bad ignoring him,

259
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:57,340
but eventually I had to turn off my phone.

260
00:10:58,680 --> 00:11:00,800
Dozens of calls.

261
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:03,080
He must've said something, right?

262
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:05,000
Nothing important.

263
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:06,680
Just asking

264
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:08,080
if I ate,

265
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:09,200
slept,

266
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:10,480
drank water,

267
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,650
or if I was tired.

268
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,880
Just small talk, anyway.

269
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:16,920
I couldn't take it after a couple of days.

270
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:17,880
I told him,

271
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,200
"If you keep this up,

272
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,440
we can't even be friends

273
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,320
anymore."

274
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:27,960
Go

275
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,280
on.

276
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:33,040
After I said that,

277
00:11:33,640 --> 00:11:34,880
he did stop

278
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:36,340
calling me so frequently.

279
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,740
But the day before yesterday,

280
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:40,520
he called me again.

281
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,120
Alright,

282
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,520
next move.

283
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:58,680
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

284
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:05,520
Two, two, three, four, five, six, seven.

285
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:16,040
Six, seven, eight.

286
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,520
Sir, can I help you?

287
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:33,800
Well,

288
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:35,680
I'm here to see a friend.

289
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:37,120
She's a teacher here.

290
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:39,040
A teacher?

291
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:40,200
What's her name?

292
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:42,400
Shen Xi. She teaches dance.

293
00:12:42,800 --> 00:12:43,600
That's right.

294
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:46,200
But Ms. Shen is in class right now

295
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:47,200
and can't be disturbed.

296
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,480
Could you wait a moment?

297
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:50,340
I'll go get her when class is over.

298
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:06,880
Ms. Shen,

299
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:09,320
how much longer until class is over?

300
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:11,080
Soon.

301
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,420
About ten minutes.

302
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:13,680
Don't worry, sir.

303
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,250
No rush, no rush.

304
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:16,680
Well,

305
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:19,600
I'm here to invite her to a show.

306
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:22,440
These tickets are super hard to get,

307
00:13:22,800 --> 00:13:24,260
but I managed to snag some.

308
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:27,640
Are you Ms. Shen's new boyfriend?

309
00:13:30,880 --> 00:13:32,120
New boyfriend?

310
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:33,920
What do you mean?

311
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:35,480
Does she

312
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,800
have a boyfriend?

313
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:40,960
She used to,

314
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:42,520
but I heard they broke up.

315
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:44,680
Ms. Shen's class should be over soon.

316
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:46,120
I'll go get her.

317
00:13:47,880 --> 00:13:48,880
But in the future,

318
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:51,440
I might be her new boyfriend.

319
00:13:58,600 --> 00:13:59,400
Shen Xi!

320
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:08,170
How did you find me here?

321
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:10,000
Well,

322
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:11,840
you mentioned you worked here

323
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,640
when we had dinner the other day.

324
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:15,570
You didn't answer my calls.

325
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:17,120
I figured you were in class,

326
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:18,120
so I came over.

327
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:21,520
I hope I'm not bothering you.

328
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:23,640
What's up?

329
00:14:26,520 --> 00:14:28,720
You know about this dance drama, right?

330
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:30,720
It hasn't officially premiered yet.
It's an internal show.

331
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:32,050
Tickets are hard to get,

332
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:34,280
but I actually managed to snag some.

333
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:36,560
Come see it with me.

334
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:37,880
I saw their promos.

335
00:14:37,880 --> 00:14:39,010
It's gonna be great.

336
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,320
I don't want to go.

337
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,120
You should like it.

338
00:14:46,680 --> 00:14:48,040
It's your major.

339
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:49,400
Shen Xi,

340
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:50,880
these tickets are really hard to get.

341
00:14:50,880 --> 00:14:52,280
I said I don't want to go.

342
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,400
Ask someone else.

343
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:58,120
I really had something to do that day.

344
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:58,920
I couldn't go.

345
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:02,640
So...

346
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:06,320
did you not have time,

347
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:09,920
or did you just not want to go with me?

348
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:11,500
Is there a difference?

349
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:13,860
The result is the same. I couldn't go.

350
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:15,880
Sorry,

351
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:18,140
I have to prepare for my class.

352
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:18,890
I'm leaving.

353
00:15:33,680 --> 00:15:34,680
I know

354
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:37,120
what I did really hurt him.

355
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:39,000
But officers,

356
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,040
please try to understand me.

357
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:43,580
I feel like he has no sense of boundaries.

358
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:45,040
I don't want to keep dealing with him

359
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:46,600
or giving him hope.

360
00:15:47,040 --> 00:15:49,370
It'll only make things
hard for both of us.

361
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:51,400
Captain Weng,

362
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,600
do you have any questions?

363
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:57,520
Can anyone

364
00:15:57,520 --> 00:15:59,320
or any surveillance footage prove

365
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:01,920
that Xiao Ze came to see you
a couple of days ago?

366
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:02,640
Yes.

367
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:05,320
The receptionist, Xiaoyu.

368
00:16:05,560 --> 00:16:06,360
Call her over.

369
00:16:07,040 --> 00:16:08,120
Xiaoyu,

370
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:10,120
could you come here for a second?

371
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:14,040
Hello.

372
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:15,320
I'd like to ask,

373
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:16,200
did a tall, thin guy

374
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:18,440
with big eyes come looking for her

375
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:20,000
a couple of days ago?

376
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:23,200
That boy stood there for a long time.

377
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:25,400
After work that day, I even told Ms. Shen

378
00:16:25,640 --> 00:16:27,680
that he looked quite sincere

379
00:16:27,680 --> 00:16:28,680
and she should consider him.

380
00:16:28,680 --> 00:16:30,080
What did Ms. Shen say?

381
00:16:30,520 --> 00:16:32,920
Sincerity doesn't necessarily mean love.

382
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,120
Thank you.

383
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:38,400
I'll check the surveillance footage
in a bit.

384
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:39,530
Sorry to bother you.

385
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:42,760
Mr. Shen,

386
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:44,080
please continue.

387
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:46,840
Then,

388
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:49,160
the day I went home...

389
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:50,960
I had just walked in the door.

390
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:55,640
I guess he was still watching me
through the binoculars.

391
00:16:55,640 --> 00:16:58,300
Anyway, I had only been home
for a few minutes...

392
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:05,920
Who is it?

393
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:13,400
Xiao Ze,

394
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:15,359
is that you?

395
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:17,930
Stop playing tricks, will you?

